WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.760 --> 03:11.040
Why didn't you just tell your granddaughter the truth?

3
03:11.880 --> 03:14.360
Hathaya has suffered enough already.

4
03:14.440 --> 03:18.880
I don't want my granddaughter to worry any more than she already does.

5
03:18.960 --> 03:20.320
What are you planning?

6
03:20.400 --> 03:21.920
Hathaya is trending right now.

7
03:22.000 --> 03:22.720
PREVIOUSLY

8
03:22.800 --> 03:24.080
If we use this opportunity,

9
03:24.160 --> 03:27.200
we can turn a crisis into an advantage.

10
03:27.280 --> 03:30.560
I'd like you to talk to Mr. Pichai and ask for his permission for me

11
03:30.640 --> 03:34.360
to seriously date Chayanee.

12
03:34.440 --> 03:35.880
Chayanee.

13
03:35.960 --> 03:38.600
Raiwin brought Mr. Saksit. They're already here.

14
03:38.680 --> 03:40.440
-Thank you very much. -Right.

15
03:40.520 --> 03:41.640
The roses are beautiful.

16
03:42.840 --> 03:44.720
What's the occasion?

17
03:44.800 --> 03:46.920
That's a long story.

18
03:47.960 --> 03:50.120
Roses represent love.

19
03:50.200 --> 03:54.160
I'm here today as Raiwin's father.

20
03:56.160 --> 03:58.160
He insisted that we should make things official.

21
03:58.240 --> 03:59.920
Make what official?

22
04:01.720 --> 04:03.160
Chayanee is here right on time.

23
04:18.279 --> 04:20.880
Sir, Miss Hathaya is here.

24
04:31.640 --> 04:32.760
Hello, Uncle Saksit.

25
04:33.920 --> 04:35.240
Hello, Miss Hathaya.

26
04:39.600 --> 04:40.400
Hello.

27
04:43.960 --> 04:46.840
Grandpa, Aunt Ann said you were asking for me.

28
04:46.920 --> 04:48.400
I didn't know you had guests.

29
04:48.480 --> 04:50.480
Well, you're here now. Stay here and wait.

30
04:52.960 --> 04:53.800
Yes.

31
04:53.880 --> 04:56.880
Let's get back to the important matter.

32
04:58.440 --> 05:00.880
Mr. Saksit, is there something you wanted to discuss?

33
05:03.920 --> 05:06.280
I'll get straight to the point.

34
05:08.280 --> 05:12.760
My son Raiwin has feelings for your granddaughter.

35
05:14.400 --> 05:17.320
He asked me to come and ask you for permission

36
05:17.400 --> 05:19.280
so they can do this properly.

37
05:19.360 --> 05:22.440
I understand that love and attraction are personal matters.

38
05:23.600 --> 05:27.240
But I admire young people who show respect

39
05:27.760 --> 05:29.280
to the woman's elders.

40
05:29.920 --> 05:30.920
Raiwin.

41
05:34.000 --> 05:35.760
Thank you, Mr. Pichai.

42
05:42.240 --> 05:43.080
I…

43
05:44.360 --> 05:48.760
I would like to ask your permission to date Hathaya.

44
06:09.520 --> 06:12.160
Mr. Raiwin, did you say the wrong name?

45
06:13.600 --> 06:17.040
Dad, I love Chayanee, not Hathaya.

46
06:17.120 --> 06:19.360
Love is one thing,

47
06:20.080 --> 06:23.200
but right now, you need to think about your future.

48
06:23.280 --> 06:26.120
Understand? Hathaya is getting

49
06:26.200 --> 06:27.640
a lot of attention right now.

50
06:27.720 --> 06:30.720
You need to ride that wave.

51
06:30.800 --> 06:31.760
He didn't.

52
06:32.960 --> 06:34.280
He asked me to come here himself.

53
06:35.600 --> 06:37.480
I really do want to date Hathaya.

54
06:45.000 --> 06:48.800
If you were talking about Chayanee, I wouldn't be surprised at all.

55
06:49.320 --> 06:51.000
You've known each other for a long time.

56
06:51.920 --> 06:54.120
But Hathaya has only been here a short while.

57
06:55.440 --> 06:57.840
When did the two of you become so close?

58
06:58.840 --> 07:00.720
I only recently met Hathaya,

59
07:01.440 --> 07:02.840
but I'm very impressed by her.

60
07:03.680 --> 07:07.320
She is selfless, and she stands up for what is right for other people.

61
07:08.240 --> 07:10.720
I know this may be too soon.

62
07:11.280 --> 07:15.920
That's why I want to ask you for the opportunity to get to know her better.

63
07:17.360 --> 07:21.240
I already said that love is between two people.

64
07:21.760 --> 07:23.440
If you care for each other, fine.

65
07:25.600 --> 07:29.040
Just don't do anything inappropriate.

66
07:31.360 --> 07:32.560
Thank you.

67
07:50.800 --> 07:51.640
I don't think

68
07:52.280 --> 07:56.600
that outfit suits you. Better stick to your construction clothes.

69
07:57.520 --> 08:00.720
Thanks for the advice, but next time, don't.

70
08:01.320 --> 08:02.360
Get in.

71
08:04.360 --> 08:06.520
I'm definitely not riding in the truck bed.

72
08:06.600 --> 08:08.160
Suit yourself.

73
08:09.280 --> 08:11.440
Come on. Get in.

74
08:14.360 --> 08:15.280
Hathaya.

75
08:17.440 --> 08:18.280
I'll drive you.

76
08:22.920 --> 08:23.760
Thank you.

77
08:43.400 --> 08:46.360
Madam, hurry and comfort Miss Chayanee.

78
08:46.440 --> 08:48.840
She's probably tearing the place apart by now.

79
08:56.680 --> 08:58.720
Chamoi, go outside.

80
09:13.960 --> 09:15.240
Chayanee.

81
09:17.520 --> 09:18.920
Cry if you need to, sweetheart.

82
09:19.600 --> 09:21.240
Go ahead and cry.

83
09:23.440 --> 09:25.880
When you sit there in silence like this,

84
09:26.680 --> 09:28.160
it only makes me worry more.

85
09:35.080 --> 09:38.920
Why does she always have to keep hurting me?

86
09:41.960 --> 09:44.000
Dad died because of her.

87
09:46.520 --> 09:48.600
Then she stole my project from me.

88
09:49.560 --> 09:52.680
And now she's trying to steal the man I love.

89
09:55.000 --> 09:59.360
I hate her, Mom. I hate her.

90
10:00.680 --> 10:02.200
I hate her too, Chayanee.

91
10:06.320 --> 10:07.360
Chayanee.

92
10:08.760 --> 10:11.560
My daughter has to be strong.

93
10:15.160 --> 10:16.800
Don't let her win.

94
10:18.600 --> 10:20.520
I'll never let her.

95
10:22.000 --> 10:25.520
I'm going to take back everything that belongs to me.

96
10:45.640 --> 10:46.480
Mr. Raiwin.

97
10:47.680 --> 10:48.520
Yes?

98
10:49.040 --> 10:52.440
Why do you want to get to know me?

99
10:53.000 --> 10:56.280
We're practically strangers.

100
10:56.800 --> 10:58.160
You know very little about me.

101
10:59.480 --> 11:01.160
I don't care how long I've known someone.

102
11:01.880 --> 11:07.440
Even after years together, it doesn't always work out.

103
11:10.520 --> 11:14.600
Then why do you want to date me?

104
11:17.120 --> 11:19.640
I like the way you think. I like your attitude.

105
11:21.520 --> 11:22.560
Do you know

106
11:23.200 --> 11:24.840
how impressed I was with you that day?

107
11:27.560 --> 11:28.760
Chief.

108
11:29.360 --> 11:32.600
True democracy isn't only about listening to the majority.

109
11:33.200 --> 11:34.800
It also means listening to the minority.

110
11:35.400 --> 11:36.800
We need to work together to solve this.

111
11:36.880 --> 11:40.200
We need to find the fairest solution and proceed.

112
11:41.640 --> 11:45.960
Believe it or not, my whole life, I've never once argued with my father.

113
11:47.480 --> 11:48.400
But that day,

114
11:49.560 --> 11:53.720
you had the courage to speak up. You weren't afraid to speak your mind

115
11:53.800 --> 11:54.880
and do what's right.

116
12:00.120 --> 12:01.160
I like you.

117
12:07.520 --> 12:08.920
What about you?

118
12:12.560 --> 12:13.720
Could you date me?

119
12:16.040 --> 12:16.920
Uh…

120
12:19.440 --> 12:23.080
I think it's too soon.

121
12:25.320 --> 12:27.680
You've always given other people a chance.

122
12:28.840 --> 12:29.840
Give me one too.

123
12:37.840 --> 12:38.720
All right.

124
12:39.800 --> 12:42.040
Then let time prove it.

125
12:43.400 --> 12:44.280
Okay.

126
12:45.720 --> 12:47.440
I'll prove to you that

127
12:48.360 --> 12:51.600
I like you and that I'm sincere.

128
12:58.040 --> 13:01.040
I think we should get going.

129
13:03.320 --> 13:04.160
Right.

130
13:35.640 --> 13:36.720
Hey, Max!

131
13:36.800 --> 13:39.480
You scared me! It's me. Who are you looking for, boss?

132
13:40.560 --> 13:41.800
A worker.

133
13:41.880 --> 13:43.920
Who? Oh!

134
13:44.000 --> 13:46.680
I saw your brother

135
13:46.760 --> 13:49.320
drop Hathaya off at the model home earlier.

136
13:50.880 --> 13:52.320
Isn't she working with us anymore?

137
13:53.280 --> 13:55.000
Mr. Pichai put her on the sales team.

138
13:56.200 --> 13:57.440
Damn, that's a shame.

139
13:57.520 --> 14:00.320
No more pretty girl around to brighten up the place.

140
14:02.880 --> 14:03.760
Max.

141
14:03.840 --> 14:06.080
-Come with me. -Where are we going?

142
14:06.160 --> 14:08.120
Wait for me, boss.

143
14:08.200 --> 14:09.400
What the hell?

144
14:10.520 --> 14:11.880
Wait up!

145
14:15.440 --> 14:19.960
Hey, Max. Go check whether any of the faucets are leaking.

146
14:22.080 --> 14:25.800
Go on. Upstairs. Hurry.

147
14:40.680 --> 14:43.160
You can take them to sign the agreement now.

148
14:43.720 --> 14:45.080
Right this way, please.

149
14:51.320 --> 14:52.760
Do you have something to tell me?

150
14:54.640 --> 14:56.160
No. Nothing.

151
15:01.440 --> 15:02.680
Really?

152
15:02.760 --> 15:04.720
-Well… -Well, what?

153
15:06.360 --> 15:08.560
-Maybe I do. -Then say it.

154
15:09.760 --> 15:10.880
Do you like Raiwin?

155
15:12.760 --> 15:15.200
Well, he's good looking.

156
15:15.280 --> 15:17.080
And he's a gentleman.

157
15:19.200 --> 15:23.320
You just met him. How do you know he's a gentleman?

158
15:24.760 --> 15:29.000
At least he's better than you. He's not aggressive, and he actually respects me.

159
15:30.680 --> 15:34.080
Look. Don't trust people so easily.

160
15:34.160 --> 15:36.080
I don't want you to end up being used.

161
15:36.160 --> 15:39.000
That family will do anything for their own benefit.

162
15:39.840 --> 15:40.920
Oh,

163
15:41.520 --> 15:44.880
and watch yourself. Your little sister might not be too happy about this.

164
15:46.320 --> 15:48.200
What are you trying to tell me?

165
15:48.280 --> 15:49.640
Why bring up Chayanee?

166
15:49.720 --> 15:51.000
Boss.

167
15:51.960 --> 15:54.760
The faucets are fine. Nothing's broken. What am I supposed to fix?

168
15:57.200 --> 15:58.600
Go back to the site then.

169
16:00.720 --> 16:02.840
Go. Go!

170
16:02.920 --> 16:04.720
Then why did you drag me over here?

171
16:04.800 --> 16:06.000
Max, wait.

172
16:07.120 --> 16:08.720
Can I ask you something?

173
16:10.160 --> 16:11.080
What is it?

174
16:44.920 --> 16:47.920
Boss isn't Mr. Saksit's biological son.

175
16:48.000 --> 16:53.040
His mom had him before meeting Mr. Saksit, so only Raiwin is his biological son.

176
16:53.680 --> 16:57.400
But everyone knows Raiwin and Chayanee are together.

177
16:57.480 --> 16:59.160
That's why I'm confused too.

178
16:59.240 --> 17:01.800
Why would he still drive you here?

179
17:01.880 --> 17:03.040
I really don't get it.

180
17:03.120 --> 17:05.560
He has a girlfriend, but he's still chasing someone else.

181
17:10.960 --> 17:12.319
I came to return the card.

182
17:13.160 --> 17:14.680
I probably won't be back anymore.

183
17:18.200 --> 17:19.000
I'm sorry.

184
17:20.000 --> 17:21.520
You lied to me!

185
17:23.119 --> 17:25.800
You said your father was going to ask permission to date me.

186
17:27.000 --> 17:29.200
But in the end, you wanted Hathaya.

187
17:30.760 --> 17:32.720
I told my father to ask for you.

188
17:34.240 --> 17:37.040
But he ordered me to date Hathaya.

189
17:37.120 --> 17:38.520
How old are you?

190
17:39.240 --> 17:42.240
Nine? Ten? Do you still need your father telling you what to do?

191
17:42.320 --> 17:43.680
Are you just his dog on a leash?

192
17:43.760 --> 17:46.240
-That's going too far. -What did I say that was wrong?

193
17:46.320 --> 17:47.840
Your father tells you to turn left,

194
17:47.920 --> 17:51.720
you turn left. He tells you to turn right, you turn right.

195
17:52.240 --> 17:55.360
If your father told you to go die, would you go die too?!

196
17:55.440 --> 17:57.240
Then what do you want me to do?

197
18:31.720 --> 18:33.400
Do you still love me?

198
18:37.600 --> 18:39.920
Answer me. Do you still love me?

199
18:41.880 --> 18:43.080
Raiwin.

200
18:47.000 --> 18:48.320
What do you want me to do?

201
18:54.440 --> 18:56.200
You don't have to do anything.

202
18:58.360 --> 19:01.440
Just keep being your father's precious son.

203
19:01.520 --> 19:03.640
That's all. I'll take care of everything else.

204
19:35.120 --> 19:36.160
Chaya.

205
19:39.040 --> 19:41.600
I'm sorry.

206
19:42.120 --> 19:44.920
I didn't know you and Raiwin had been together.

207
19:47.920 --> 19:50.280
Do you think I'm upset, Hathaya?

208
19:53.720 --> 19:56.560
Yes, I am upset.

209
19:57.560 --> 20:01.120
But what can I do? We all have to move on.

210
20:02.680 --> 20:05.760
I'll talk to him. You and I can still be friends.

211
20:05.840 --> 20:08.000
You don't need to do anything.

212
20:09.600 --> 20:13.600
My relationship is over. And I don't want to talk about it anymore.

213
20:18.000 --> 20:19.760
Don't worry.

214
20:20.360 --> 20:23.120
We're sisters. We share the same blood.

215
20:23.760 --> 20:27.000
We shouldn't let an outsider come between us and drive us apart.

216
20:29.840 --> 20:33.840
Thank you so much for caring about how I feel,

217
20:34.360 --> 20:36.200
my wonderful big sister.

218
20:55.760 --> 20:56.720
Then I'll get going.

219
21:13.280 --> 21:14.960
I already have a plan.

220
21:23.960 --> 21:24.960
She's inside.

221
21:36.160 --> 21:39.200
I told you not to upset the customers.

222
21:40.160 --> 21:43.440
Give them what they want. Then you can send the money home.

223
21:44.640 --> 21:46.040
See what happens when you resist?

224
21:54.520 --> 21:56.680
Come here. Does it hurt badly?

225
22:01.600 --> 22:03.960
Okay. Don't be afraid.

226
22:04.600 --> 22:08.480
I'll take you to the hospital. Then I'll take you home.

227
22:29.280 --> 22:32.280
I just finished some business. What can I do for you, Ms. Liu?

228
22:32.800 --> 22:34.160
Just tell me.

229
22:56.240 --> 22:58.040
You're finished here. Go.

230
23:00.160 --> 23:01.080
Yes.

231
23:02.680 --> 23:03.760
Stay for a moment.

232
23:25.480 --> 23:28.640
Aunt Liu, do you need anything else? I can get it for you.

233
23:29.800 --> 23:31.200
No need, sweetheart.

234
23:35.920 --> 23:37.080
Father.

235
23:37.160 --> 23:39.840
Chayanee and I were thinking

236
23:39.920 --> 23:42.400
that so many good things have happened to our family lately.

237
23:42.480 --> 23:46.480
There's the success in the development, and now Mr. Saksit's son

238
23:46.560 --> 23:49.640
has asked to date Hathaya.

239
23:57.080 --> 23:59.720
Mom and I thought we should

240
24:00.360 --> 24:02.920
have a small celebration.

241
24:06.080 --> 24:08.920
Something this minor doesn't need a celebration.

242
24:09.960 --> 24:12.280
But Grandpa,

243
24:12.360 --> 24:15.560
I want to hold a party to celebrate Hathaya coming home.

244
24:15.640 --> 24:18.960
Please, Grandpa.

245
24:20.760 --> 24:22.640
Fine.

246
24:22.720 --> 24:27.080
Keep it private. Nothing too formal.

247
24:27.880 --> 24:29.120
Thank you, Grandpa.

248
24:29.200 --> 24:32.480
I love you more than anyone.

249
24:33.840 --> 24:35.400
Then,

250
24:35.480 --> 24:39.560
we'll keep it simple. We'll only invite Mr. Saksit's family.

251
24:39.640 --> 24:43.440
After all, our families may soon be joined together.

252
24:48.000 --> 24:50.680
Hathaya, make sure you're ready.

253
24:52.560 --> 24:54.200
Thank you, Chaya.

254
24:58.120 --> 25:00.200
Then so be it.

255
25:15.480 --> 25:18.240
I'm going to be honest with you, Miss Hathaya.

256
25:19.520 --> 25:22.600
I don't understand this at all, and I don't feel good about it.

257
25:22.680 --> 25:25.840
Why would Madam and Miss Chayanee suddenly

258
25:25.920 --> 25:28.240
want to throw you a welcome party

259
25:28.320 --> 25:31.720
when they've been trying to drive you out this whole time?

260
25:33.880 --> 25:36.520
Maybe Aunt Liu finally sees that I came here with good intentions.

261
25:36.600 --> 25:38.120
I'm here to help Grandpa.

262
25:38.640 --> 25:41.080
I'd bet my life on it.

263
25:41.160 --> 25:43.600
I've been with Madam a long time.

264
25:43.680 --> 25:46.760
I know exactly what those two are like.

265
25:46.840 --> 25:49.160
They hate anyone getting more attention than them.

266
25:50.160 --> 25:52.240
Then what do you want me to do, Aunt Ann?

267
25:53.320 --> 25:57.920
I really wish this party wasn't happening. I just have a bad feeling about it.

268
26:00.720 --> 26:02.400
Stop right there!

269
26:02.480 --> 26:06.360
You two are gossiping about my beloved boss. I'm going to tell her.

270
26:07.120 --> 26:11.120
Madam finally opened her heart and accepted you parasites,

271
26:11.200 --> 26:14.520
and this is how you repay her, thinking such evil thoughts?

272
26:15.120 --> 26:19.000
I guess some people are just content being parasites.

273
26:19.800 --> 26:23.720
My boss does good for sinners and gets nothing in return.

274
26:23.800 --> 26:26.640
Who are you calling a sinner? You're the real sinner.

275
26:26.720 --> 26:28.440
The King of Hell and the Grim Reaper

276
26:28.520 --> 26:31.320
already have a place waiting for you. Do you even know that?

277
26:31.400 --> 26:33.760
-Watch your mouth! -Wait!

278
26:34.440 --> 26:37.040
Please don't fight. Please.

279
26:38.480 --> 26:41.760
Aunt Ann, it's time for me to go to work.

280
26:42.680 --> 26:43.920
Can you take over here?

281
26:44.000 --> 26:45.160
No!

282
26:45.240 --> 26:47.680
You're staying here as a servant,

283
26:47.760 --> 26:51.200
so you have to work. You can't keep making excuses.

284
26:51.280 --> 26:53.320
Go ahead, Miss Hathaya.

285
26:53.400 --> 26:55.320
It's fine.

286
26:55.400 --> 26:56.400
Bye. Bye.

287
26:57.560 --> 26:59.040
Hey!

288
26:59.120 --> 27:01.320
Don't make such a big deal out of everything.

289
27:01.400 --> 27:06.200
If one day Mr. Pichai accepts her and she becomes his favorite granddaughter,

290
27:06.280 --> 27:07.840
you'll have no place left here.

291
27:07.920 --> 27:11.880
Just because one video went viral? She won't be his favorite.

292
27:11.960 --> 27:14.720
Don't imagine things.

293
27:14.800 --> 27:16.000
Chamoi, stop right now!

294
27:16.080 --> 27:18.240
-Why? -You really want to test me?

295
27:18.320 --> 27:21.440
Come at me then!

296
27:30.200 --> 27:31.680
Careful.

297
27:32.280 --> 27:33.320
I'm sorry.

298
27:33.400 --> 27:36.120
My name is Pong. I'm here to work for Mr. Pichai.

299
27:36.720 --> 27:39.960
Nice to meet you. I'm in a hurry, so I need to get to work.

300
27:40.720 --> 27:41.680
Of course.

301
27:49.160 --> 27:52.960
Last year, Pong resigned to take care of his sick mother.

302
27:53.040 --> 27:55.120
Now that she's recovered,

303
27:55.200 --> 27:59.160
he would like to come back and work here again.

304
28:01.480 --> 28:03.320
I can drive for you

305
28:03.400 --> 28:07.400
or supervise work like I used to. I can do anything you need, sir.

306
28:08.000 --> 28:09.120
That's good.

307
28:09.640 --> 28:11.880
The development could use some extra help.

308
28:13.200 --> 28:14.480
Thank you, sir.

309
28:14.560 --> 28:19.440
Then I'll have Pong stay in his old room in the workers' quarters.

310
28:23.800 --> 28:25.960
Hathaya is already staying there.

311
28:29.680 --> 28:31.280
Let him stay in the room at the back.

312
28:31.360 --> 28:32.400
Yes, sir.

313
28:34.600 --> 28:37.200
I wanted you to stay over there.

314
28:37.280 --> 28:39.240
It would've made it easier to get close to Hathaya.

315
28:39.320 --> 28:42.680
Too bad Father is making you stay back here.

316
28:43.200 --> 28:44.560
You know me, madam.

317
28:45.440 --> 28:47.800
Distance is never a problem for me.

318
28:48.600 --> 28:51.600
I'm very good at making my move.

319
28:53.920 --> 28:56.320
You'd better be as good as you say.

320
28:56.400 --> 28:58.840
Don't make me regret calling you back.

321
29:00.880 --> 29:04.280
I won't disappoint you, madam.

322
29:31.400 --> 29:33.480
Ploy, please take care of the customer for me.

323
29:43.400 --> 29:45.360
Why are you here?

324
29:50.560 --> 29:52.520
Raiwin asked me to bring this to you.

325
29:53.040 --> 29:55.640
He said he wants you to wear this outfit to the party.

326
29:58.800 --> 30:00.080
Thank you.

327
30:00.920 --> 30:04.080
Where is Raiwin? Why didn't he come himself?

328
30:04.680 --> 30:05.520
Hey.

329
30:06.400 --> 30:08.560
My name is Ramil, not Raiwin.

330
30:08.640 --> 30:10.440
If you want to know, ask him yourself.

331
30:11.680 --> 30:13.000
My job here is done.

332
30:13.080 --> 30:14.120
Wait.

333
30:14.680 --> 30:16.040
Are you coming tonight?

334
30:16.760 --> 30:20.520
It's not my party, and there's nothing interesting about it anyway.

335
30:23.800 --> 30:24.880
I'm leaving.

336
30:42.720 --> 30:44.000
What was he doing here?

337
30:44.960 --> 30:47.480
Raiwin sent an outfit for me.

338
30:49.120 --> 30:53.360
Hathaya, don't trust that man too much. He's dangerous.

339
30:55.160 --> 30:58.120
What's wrong with Ramil?

340
30:59.480 --> 31:01.840
I'll tell you later.

341
31:03.960 --> 31:06.400
At the party, you must be the most beautiful woman.

342
31:07.360 --> 31:09.640
Can I see what you're going to wear?

343
31:10.680 --> 31:12.840
Of course. I'll show you.

344
31:33.120 --> 31:33.960
Step down.

345
31:34.480 --> 31:35.600
Alright.

346
31:39.360 --> 31:40.840
Careful, Father.

347
31:43.000 --> 31:44.120
Hello.

348
31:44.200 --> 31:45.600
-Hello, Mr. Pichai. -Hello.

349
31:45.680 --> 31:47.400
Hello, Chief.

350
31:47.480 --> 31:48.960
Hello.

351
31:49.040 --> 31:52.760
Thank you for honoring my family with an invitation tonight.

352
31:52.840 --> 31:54.240
We're all practically family.

353
31:55.760 --> 31:59.400
How has Ramil been? If he's caused you any trouble or upset you in any way,

354
31:59.480 --> 32:00.800
I apologize on his behalf.

355
32:00.880 --> 32:03.800
Please don't worry about that, Mrs. Sanguansri.

356
32:03.880 --> 32:07.240
Ramil has taken a huge burden off my shoulders.

357
32:07.320 --> 32:08.760
Thank you very much.

358
32:11.760 --> 32:12.600
Hello, sir.

359
32:21.800 --> 32:24.840
Did you invite him here too?

360
32:25.440 --> 32:26.240
I didn't.

361
32:26.320 --> 32:27.920
-Then how-- -I invited Ramil myself.

362
32:28.560 --> 32:29.840
I wanted him to have fun too.

363
32:29.920 --> 32:31.360
Oh. Alright.

364
32:38.240 --> 32:40.520
Where's Hathaya?

365
32:41.400 --> 32:45.800
You're impatient, Raiwin. You want to see the star of the evening?

366
32:47.160 --> 32:48.400
There she is.

367
33:47.880 --> 33:49.760
Hello.

368
33:52.560 --> 33:53.840
Thank you for doing this.

369
33:59.000 --> 34:02.360
I've been hearing your name for a while. Today is the first time I've met you.

370
34:03.040 --> 34:04.800
You're very beautiful and sweet.

371
34:06.680 --> 34:07.960
Thank you very much.

372
34:14.480 --> 34:17.800
Everyone, the food is ready. Please come.

373
34:44.040 --> 34:45.600
Nothing left to do here. Take a break.

374
34:46.760 --> 34:47.960
Okay.

375
35:02.960 --> 35:05.480
I'm going to throw a party for Hathaya.

376
35:06.000 --> 35:08.520
Chayanee will get her drunk.

377
35:09.040 --> 35:12.040
Then you take care of her.

378
35:22.320 --> 35:24.000
You look very beautiful tonight.

379
35:24.960 --> 35:27.840
Dad and Auntie haven't stopped complimenting you.

380
35:29.400 --> 35:32.280
I should thank you for this dress.

381
35:33.480 --> 35:35.720
I wanted you to look more beautiful than anyone else,

382
35:35.800 --> 35:38.000
so every man in the world would be jealous.

383
35:39.160 --> 35:41.000
You're exaggerating.

384
35:43.880 --> 35:47.200
There's at least one man here who's definitely jealous.

385
36:03.000 --> 36:04.240
I'll get you another one.

386
36:05.280 --> 36:06.480
Thank you.

387
36:12.720 --> 36:15.720
Ramil, make me a drink.

388
36:23.880 --> 36:24.800
What are you doing?

389
36:25.720 --> 36:26.720
What do you mean?

390
36:27.720 --> 36:28.960
I'm not stupid.

391
36:30.120 --> 36:32.000
You've been with Chayanee for a long time.

392
36:33.240 --> 36:34.440
Now you've changed your mind?

393
36:35.640 --> 36:38.840
It's none of your business. Just make the drink.

394
36:46.480 --> 36:47.520
Have a drink with me.

395
36:59.640 --> 37:03.880
Chaya. Are you going to tell me what happened with Ramil?

396
37:07.320 --> 37:09.000
When he was in college,

397
37:09.560 --> 37:11.240
he raped a woman.

398
37:14.040 --> 37:16.760
Then why didn't she press charges?

399
37:18.280 --> 37:21.600
She was afraid of ruining her reputation, so she didn't dare tell anyone.

400
37:23.240 --> 37:25.680
But everything came out when she got pregnant.

401
37:27.240 --> 37:28.280
She got pregnant?

402
37:30.800 --> 37:33.560
She had to drop out of college.

403
37:33.640 --> 37:37.840
After that, nobody ever talked about it again.

404
37:39.480 --> 37:41.280
How could he do something like that?

405
37:43.680 --> 37:47.240
You know Ramil is a mama's boy,

406
37:47.320 --> 37:49.760
and he isn't Uncle Saksit's biological son.

407
37:51.120 --> 37:54.640
When he was little, he was probably jealous of Raiwin.

408
37:54.720 --> 37:58.320
Whenever Raiwin got something, Ramil always wanted to take it from him.

409
37:59.440 --> 38:02.880
Was that woman Raiwin's girlfriend?

410
38:06.560 --> 38:07.920
That's awful.

411
38:08.000 --> 38:09.360
Does Grandpa know about this?

412
38:11.120 --> 38:15.160
There's no evidence. If we said anything, people would accuse us of slandering him.

413
38:15.760 --> 38:17.920
I'm only telling you

414
38:18.440 --> 38:22.120
because I'm afraid you might become his next victim.

415
38:25.680 --> 38:28.320
I'm not going anywhere near a man like that.

416
38:39.160 --> 38:42.400
If you don't love her, and you don't really care about her,

417
38:43.400 --> 38:44.840
don't hurt her.

418
38:45.640 --> 38:47.040
Why do you care?

419
38:47.640 --> 38:51.360
I have to care. Because every time you create a problem,

420
38:52.200 --> 38:53.880
I'm the one who has to fix it.

421
38:53.960 --> 38:55.120
That's your problem.

422
38:56.040 --> 38:58.480
I don't want another woman becoming your victim.

423
38:59.480 --> 39:00.880
Let go.

424
39:10.720 --> 39:12.240
Go drag him home.

425
39:13.360 --> 39:14.360
Yes.

426
39:19.360 --> 39:21.160
You're drunk. That's enough.

427
39:21.240 --> 39:22.640
Don't drive when you're drunk.

428
39:24.720 --> 39:27.200
Why? Are you worried about me?

429
39:27.280 --> 39:28.520
Mr. Pichai,

430
39:29.400 --> 39:31.360
please excuse me for a moment.

431
39:31.960 --> 39:33.000
Of course.

432
39:39.680 --> 39:41.640
Come on, dear. I'll ask Max to drive you home.

433
39:41.720 --> 39:42.760
Come on.

434
39:44.200 --> 39:48.600
I told you to drag him home!

435
39:52.360 --> 39:54.160
So your husband sent you.

436
39:58.080 --> 39:59.720
Come on. Come home with me.

437
39:59.800 --> 40:01.800
I'm not going. I'm still having fun.

438
40:01.880 --> 40:05.480
You're always causing trouble for other people. Go home.

439
40:05.560 --> 40:08.480
You're not my father. Don't tell me what to do.

440
40:09.840 --> 40:10.920
Ramil.

441
40:12.600 --> 40:14.640
Ramil. Listen.

442
40:15.480 --> 40:17.800
If he causes any trouble,

443
40:17.880 --> 40:20.240
you'll be responsible. Understand?

444
40:28.120 --> 40:30.480
I can't drink anymore, Chaya.

445
40:32.040 --> 40:35.800
Just one more glass, Hathaya. This is the last one.

446
40:41.960 --> 40:43.240
The last one.

447
40:51.520 --> 40:52.680
Bottoms up.

448
41:01.680 --> 41:05.320
I'll go get you another one.

449
41:07.040 --> 41:08.840
I really can't drink anymore.

450
41:09.360 --> 41:12.440
Don't be difficult. I went through all this trouble to convince Grandpa

451
41:12.520 --> 41:15.320
to throw this party for my beloved sister.

452
41:20.320 --> 41:21.480
I'll go refill your glass.

453
41:44.880 --> 41:45.840
Where are you going?

454
41:49.920 --> 41:50.760
Hey!

455
41:57.280 --> 41:58.280
Hathaya.

456
42:02.200 --> 42:03.960
Stay away from me!

457
42:04.680 --> 42:08.120
Why? Am I really that disgusting?

458
42:11.160 --> 42:13.240
I'm not that different from Raiwin.

459
42:13.320 --> 42:16.040
I'm clean too. If you don't believe me, smell me.

460
42:16.760 --> 42:18.560
Don't touch me!

461
42:19.280 --> 42:21.160
A man like you is disgusting.

462
42:21.240 --> 42:23.120
What do you mean by that?

463
42:24.400 --> 42:25.840
Who said what about me this time?

464
42:25.920 --> 42:28.680
You know perfectly well what you did.

465
42:29.200 --> 42:32.400
Stay away from me. I don't want to be anywhere near someone like you.

466
42:47.960 --> 42:49.960
Yes, madam. I'm ready.

467
43:14.400 --> 43:15.840
Hathaya, are you okay?

468
43:17.520 --> 43:19.480
Not really.

469
43:20.200 --> 43:22.200
I'll take you to your room.

470
43:39.280 --> 43:40.960
Chaya.

471
43:41.720 --> 43:44.000
I'm so dizzy.

472
43:45.080 --> 43:46.640
Why is everything spinning?

473
43:46.720 --> 43:50.000
Lie down and rest. You'll feel better tomorrow.

474
43:53.320 --> 43:54.800
Chaya!

475
43:54.880 --> 43:56.880
Chaya. Don't go.

476
43:57.920 --> 44:00.520
Stay with me. Promise me.

477
44:01.120 --> 44:03.400
Okay, Hathaya. Get some rest.

478
44:04.640 --> 44:06.320
Stay with me.

479
44:31.880 --> 44:32.880
Who's that?

480
44:44.240 --> 44:47.440
Our part is done. Let's go back and enjoy the party.

481
44:59.800 --> 45:01.160
He's heading to Hathaya's room.

482
45:30.160 --> 45:31.720
-Raiwin. -Yes?

483
45:31.800 --> 45:33.480
Have you seen Hathaya?

484
45:34.080 --> 45:36.040
-No. -Is something wrong?

485
45:37.360 --> 45:41.000
I was bringing her another drink, but I don't know where she went.

486
45:42.520 --> 45:44.120
Father.

487
45:46.600 --> 45:48.040
Something disgraceful has happened.

488
45:48.120 --> 45:49.720
What happened?

489
45:50.320 --> 45:54.160
Ms. Liu, if there's anything

490
45:54.240 --> 45:55.520
we can do to help, just tell us.

491
45:56.680 --> 46:00.760
I saw Hathaya very drunk and staggering back toward her room.

492
46:00.840 --> 46:03.280
I was going to check on her, but…

493
46:04.080 --> 46:07.080
I saw her lying there with a man.

494
46:09.120 --> 46:10.640
Who was the man?

495
46:11.800 --> 46:13.640
Father, you should see for yourself.

496
46:42.080 --> 46:43.400
No! Let go!

497
46:43.960 --> 46:46.320
Help!

498
46:48.400 --> 46:50.800
Go away. Don't do this to me!

499
46:50.880 --> 46:52.480
Go away!

500
46:52.560 --> 46:56.240
Get out! Who are you?

501
47:09.120 --> 47:12.360
Help! Help!

502
47:12.440 --> 47:14.800
Shut up!

503
47:16.680 --> 47:17.960
-Help! -The hell are you doing?!

504
47:31.920 --> 47:33.640
Father, be careful.

505
47:50.000 --> 47:51.000
Hathaya.

506
47:52.800 --> 47:54.600
-Don't! -It's me, Hathaya!

507
47:54.680 --> 47:56.840
-No! Get out! -It's me. Calm down.

508
47:56.920 --> 47:59.840
-Get out! Out! -Hathaya!

509
48:02.200 --> 48:04.120
Hathaya. Hathaya.

510
48:05.800 --> 48:07.640
Good grief!

511
48:07.720 --> 48:10.240
-Ramil! -How disgraceful!

512
48:12.480 --> 48:14.440
What the hell is going on?

513
48:17.960 --> 48:20.640
This isn't what everyone thinks.

514
48:20.720 --> 48:21.800
I can explain.

515
48:25.320 --> 48:26.720
Everyone,

516
48:26.800 --> 48:28.640
I'll take care of Hathaya.

517
48:29.400 --> 48:31.920
Once she wakes up, she should be able to explain everything.

518
48:34.400 --> 48:37.240
Hathaya, are you okay?

519
48:48.080 --> 48:49.880
So, Mr. Saksit,

520
48:49.960 --> 48:51.640
how are you going to take responsibility for this?

521
48:51.720 --> 48:52.840
Well, I…

522
48:52.920 --> 48:54.080
I'll take responsibility.

523
48:54.160 --> 48:55.560
NEXT EPISODE

524
48:55.640 --> 48:56.920
If you love Hathaya,

525
48:57.840 --> 48:58.680
then go tell Mr. Pichai.

526
48:58.760 --> 49:00.440
Don't lecture me.

527
49:00.520 --> 49:03.000
I don't take another man's leftovers.

528
49:03.920 --> 49:05.360
Stop causing trouble for once!

529
49:09.200 --> 49:10.600
You're promiscuous.

530
49:11.760 --> 49:13.320
You brought this filthy mess into my house.

531
49:13.920 --> 49:15.680
You're no different from your mother.

532
49:16.360 --> 49:18.640
Then why didn't you tell Grandpa?

533
49:20.280 --> 49:22.240
Because I hate you.

534
51:14.200 --> 51:19.280
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
